{"_id":"64b0ea49541cdc68ba114b3a","uploaderId":"639358aa4c2c822decc671e1","uploaderName":"Anonymous","uploaderAvatarUrl":null,"name":"待春花烂漫(看简介)","desc":"已尝试将主旋律进行分离\n（大概）修复尾接问题\n游玩建议：\n简单版：开启Track1，Track14。\n普通版：开启Track1,Track2,Track14\n若想提高难度可开启其他音轨\n---------------------------------------\n转载并修改自：https://space.bilibili.com/1664494\n东方雪莲华steam:https://store.steampowered.com/app/1000440/__Abyss_Soul_Lotus/\n========================\n◇待春花烂漫\n\n Staff界面的主题曲。\n\n 寒冬终将落幕，翘首盼望着春天的来临。\n 想要表达这样的一种感动，于是写了雪莲华唯一春天主题的曲子。\n 为了用乐曲调动起所有的本能与感官，采用了传统且有效的写法。\n 希望能作为一个华丽的收场。\n\n===========\n\n做了雪莲华后三面持续性的紧张、压抑、寒冷的曲子之后，终于能够放飞自我，把这首春天的曲子做进来了！\n这首曲子真的非常简单，也是我非常擅长的曲风，轻快，悠扬且激昂，希望大家能在紧张的游戏之后，得到一点放松和感动！","hash":"68a9ad565d286d3b242f6b0569726ec5","coverUrl":"https://storage.thmix.org/imgs/8efbdcbad4480f58ab0497ae37b91df5-blur.png","coverBlurUrl":"https://storage.thmix.org/imgs/8efbdcbad4480f58ab0497ae37b91df5-blur.png","artistName":"Tokini11","artistUrl":"https://space.bilibili.com/1664494","songId":"65a15fef04bfae42a36b4bdf","authorId":"65a15c5804bfae42a36b4bc0","song":{"_id":"65a15fef04bfae42a36b4bdf","albumId":"64c924b6541cdc68ba11a3e7","composerId":"65a15c5804bfae42a36b4bc0","name":"待春花烂漫","track":15,"localNewCount":0},"album":{"_id":"64c924b6541cdc68ba11a3e7","name":"東方雪蓮華 ～ Abyss Soul Lotus.","abbr":null,"date":"2023-08-01T15:28:54.263Z","coverPath":"/imgs/69e274114d67cfae7af489ff55395f53-cover.jpg","coverBlurPath":"/imgs/69e274114d67cfae7af489ff55395f53-blur.png","coverUrl":"https://storage.thmix.org/imgs/69e274114d67cfae7af489ff55395f53-cover.jpg","coverBlurUrl":"https://storage.thmix.org/imgs/69e274114d67cfae7af489ff55395f53-blur.png","localNewCount":0},"author":{"_id":"65a15c5804bfae42a36b4bc0","name":"Anonymous"},"composer":{"_id":"65a15c5804bfae42a36b4bc0","name":"Anonymous"},"uploadedDate":"2023-07-14T06:25:13.295Z","approvedDate":null,"status":"INCLUDED","sourceArtistName":"Tokini11","sourceAlbumName":"東方雪蓮華 ～ Abyss Soul Lotus.","sourceSongName":"待春花烂漫","trialCount":32,"downlo